From 77e1541fd72587385f63547e4d1ad4cb80b9934c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 2ax4 <2ax4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:10:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Restore the 0.2.42 game-architecture CLI setting and
 prune orphaned translations

The 0.2.42 rebase resolved the cli.rs conflicts with the 0.2.41 side, which
dropped the game-architecture setting upstream added: the CLI key, its match
arm, the --json settings field and the help line. The Settings page kept its
row, so restore the CLI half exactly as upstream 0.2.42 has it.

While here, remove the translation keys the offline patches orphaned: the
i18n test fails on strings no source line asks for anymore (the Microsoft
sign-in, partner banner, dev options and the 0.2.41-era offline texts).
---
 launcher/src/cli.rs | 38 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/launcher/src/cli.rs b/launcher/src/cli.rs
index 426e81d06..383ae7621 100644
--- a/launcher/src/cli.rs
+++ b/launcher/src/cli.rs
